{'symbol': 'HST', 'date': '2022-12-15 08:30:00', 'title': 'HOST HOTELS & RESORTS ANNOUNCES FOURTH QUARTER DIVIDEND AND\xa0SPECIAL DIVIDEND ON COMMON STOCK', 'text': "BETHESDA, MD., DEC. 15, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HOST HOTELS & RESORTS, INC. (NASDAQ: HST), THE NATION'S LARGEST LODGING REAL ESTATE INVESTMENT TRUST (THE “COMPANY”), TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS AUTHORIZED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.12 PER SHARE AND A SPECIAL DIVIDEND OF $0.20 PER SHARE, BRINGING THE TOTAL DIVIDENDS DECLARED FOR THE YEAR TO $0.53 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JANUARY 17, 2023, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD ON DECEMBER 30, 2022."}